1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:03,960
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Helen had nothing to do one Saturday night.

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,800
Let's go to a drive-in theater, said

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,140
Donna.

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,420
Helen had no idea what that was.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,440
Donna told her she would love it.

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,260
Helen agreed to go.

7
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,840
Drive-in theaters play movies outdoors.

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,140
People park their cars in front of a

9
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,000
giant screen.

10
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,660
They each get a pair of speakers.

11
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,260
Everyone watches the movie from their cars.

12
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,560
Helen had seen many of them in old

13
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,140
movies.

14
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,260
This is where people used to go on

15
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,360
dates, she said.

16
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:40,560
She had no idea they still existed.

17
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,720
The girls watched a horror movie.

18
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:46,800
It was scarier than watching it in a

19
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,240
room with a bunch of people.

20
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:51,800
They should bring these back, said Donna.
